6. **Stop.**

## SKILLS
Loaded (relevant): threejs-qa-release (test hooks __THREE_GAME_TEST_HOOKS__ / __AGENT_STATE__ convention, references/playtest-bot.md — automated playtest). threejs-debug-profiler (camera/input/transform debugging, references/debug-profile-checklists.md, references/checklists/scene-debugging.md). threejs-gameplay-systems (FPS controls, camera-relative movement, raycast/hit detection, update order, references/gameplay-workflows.md). threejs-game-ui-designer (crosshair/health bar). threejs-aaa-graphics-builder (block visuals). game-engine/game-developer (references/3d-web-games.md). threejs-game-director not needed.

## EVIDENCE
